            "review_title": "Review at Bún Riêu Yến",
            "review_text": "karng\n305 contributions\n0\nTasty Despite the Heat\nJun 2026 • Solo\nI wouldn’t say the broth was particularly rich, but it had a good balance of sweet, sour, and savory flavors. The toppings were generous, the noodles were soft, and the herbs and vegetables tasted fresh. What I didn’t enjoy about the dining experience was the heat. Not every area of the restaurant had a fan, and even my table felt warm. Also, note that this place is always crowded. I visited at around 3:00 PM on a weekday and was lucky to find the last available table.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 8, 2026",
